  "description": "Amplitude CR2\nBuilt to last on whatever you're building to ride, the Amplitude CR2 is the perfect way to start out on the trails.\nThe 4130 cro-mo tubeset is light enough to throw around and reacts brilliantly on the trails. Sharing the same DNA as our renowned ALX, you know this thing is going to rip.\nProgress from tabletops to doubles – and even huge kickers – this bike has it all covered.\nThe RST Dirt RA fork is the ideal way to take the sting out of any misjudged landings, while the singlespeed setup keeps things simple and lets you focus on riding.\nAll you'll have to do is focus on nailing or bailing as you fill your bag of tricks until it's bulging. The CR2 will be there with you every step of the way.\nFrameAmplitude 4130 Cro-mo tubesetFork Travel100mmWheel Size26\"ForkRST Dirt RABrakesTektro Cable DiscDrivetrain25 x 12T Singlespeed Specific",
